# EXCEPTION (AUDIT_SEC_02 F-10): .env.production is intentionally tracked. It
# holds ONLY the public proxy URL (VITE_PROXY_URL), which is already baked into
# every shipped client bundle — not a secret — and the GitHub Pages CI build
# (deploy.yml → npm run build) needs it in the checkout. NEVER put a real secret
# in this file; secrets live in Render / GitHub env, never in the repo.
!.env.production
